  <data name="ConnectionDetailsHostTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A. HOST</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ConnectionDetailsHostBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Host — FTPS Server ishlayotgan qurilma manzili.
IP manzilni afzal ko‘ring. Qurilma nomi tarmoq uni aniqlasagina ishlaydi.

Quyidagilardan birini ishlating:</value>
  </data>
